@startuml kairos-branch-settings-admin-sequence
title Update Branch Settings (Admin)

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Branch Settings
WebAdmin -> API: GET /branches
API -> DB: SELECT branches
DB --> API: list
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

Admin -> WebAdmin: Edit branch details\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: PUT /branches/{id} {changes}
API -> DB: UPDATE Branch
DB --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

@enduml
